== 0. row-locality of the verdict ==
  B.side(enc, r, rule) depends on enc[r] only (83 rows x 3 rules, two perturbations): True
  hence: guard verdicts depend only on rho at L; T-A host cells only on rho at T-A; E3-REL (D12 a) only on rho at T-A \ H

