== 2. K15 (attribute reads bearer) and K16 (O -> C13 + C14 + C15): side preservation ==
  attribute -> bearer pairs, placement equal: {'C14->C13': True, 'C15->C13': True, 'C16->C13': True, 'C17->C13': True, 'C18->C13': True, 'C11->C8': True, 'C12->C8': True, 'C20->C19': True}
  O-expansion {C13, C14, C15} all CB1: True
  [FD] adding an item placed on a side the row already reads, or a co-placed bearer, never changes |sides|; both transformers are side-preserving for every row, every K1 value and every spanning rule

